      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but what's the point? even a therapist can't fix the fact that my whole world is just waiting for him to die. it feels like i'm just stuck in this purgatory where nothing ever changes and everything just gets heavier. i sometimes think i'd feel more at peace if the waiting was just... over. for both of us.",
